# Monitor Service Component

Service orchestration layer that coordinates Split and Validator monitoring subsystems.

## Key Integration Pattern
Factory pattern for service creation with dependency injection of Ethereum clients, notifiers, and Safe clients.

## Important Constraints
- Services must implement Start/Stop lifecycle methods with proper context handling
- Configuration validation must occur before service instantiation
- Each service type (Split, Validator) operates independently with its own state management